{"type":"message","id":"494cdc3a","parentId":"741fc31d","timestamp":"2026-02-18T04:20:09.381Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 09:50 GMT+5:30] Update your task: Instead of just writing a guide, IMPLEMENT the keep-alive solution for OpenClaw on Windows.\n\n**Implement directly:**\n1. Create a Windows Service wrapper for the gateway (using NSSM or sc.exe)\n2. Set power settings to prevent sleep while OpenClaw is running\n3. Configure the service to auto-start on boot\n4. Provide exact commands to install and start the service\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Script or batch file to install the service\n- Instructions to enable \"Allow wake timers\" and disable sleep on lid close\n- Verification steps to confirm OpenClaw stays running after sleep/reboot\n\nSave final implementation guide as `IMPLEMENT-keeping-openclaw-alive.md` in workspace root. Include actual commands and paths for the user's system (gateway at `D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw`).\n\nThis is an implementation task, not just documentation. Make it turnkey."}],"timestamp":1771388409377,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:pluto:main","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
